Welcome back to Models and Agents Episode 24 for April 1st, 2026.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.060
Let's see what happened in the AI world today and trust me, it's been busy.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.300
Here's what's making news in the Models and Agents world today.

